  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/08/IMG_0167.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Como cada a&ntilde;o, el vecindario de la calle Trinidad, en la Morer&iacute;a de Onda, se han juntado en una cena estival, a la que tambi&eacute;n han acudido descendientes y ascendientes, para pasar una noche muy agradable este &uacute;ltimo s&aacute;bado de agosto.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcarrertrinitat14/img_0166.jpg\" alt=\"img_0166\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcarrertrinitat14/img_0167.jpg\" alt=\"img_0167\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcarrertrinitat14/img_0168.jpg\" alt=\"img_0168\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcarrertrinitat14/img_0169.jpg\" alt=\"img_0169\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcarrertrinitat14/img_0170.jpg\" alt=\"img_0170\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcarrertrinitat14/img_0173.jpg\" alt=\"img_0173\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcarrertrinitat14/img_0174.jpg\" alt=\"img_0174\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcarrertrinitat14/img_0175.jpg\" alt=\"img_0175\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcarrertrinitat14/img_0176.jpg\" alt=\"img_0176\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/s